DATA: gt_csv TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF string,
      lv_line TYPE string.

APPEND `Material Number,Description,Quantity,Unit` TO gt_csv.
LOOP AT gt_data INTO DATA(ls_data).
  lv_line = |{ ls_data-matnr },{ ls_data-maktx },{ ls_data-menge },{ ls_data-meins }|.
  APPEND lv_line TO gt_csv.
ENDLOOP.
" then call gui_download with data_tab = gt_csv, no fieldnames


TYPES: BEGIN OF ty_header,
         label TYPE c LENGTH 40,
       END OF ty_header.

DATA gt_header TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF ty_header WITH EMPTY KEY.

gt_header = VALUE #(
  ( label = 'Material Number' )
  ( label = 'Description' )
  ( label = 'Quantity' )
  ( label = 'Unit' ) ).
